      "text": "01"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Two bundles, same ten jars, two prices — both worse than buying singles"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Baller Jars 7g – 2/$80 (weekly, ends 09-29) and Baller Jars 7g – 2/$98 (ongoing, no end date) target the identical ten Cannalicious SKUs and are both displayed."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "02"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "A daily deal named 20% Off is configured at 25%"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Daily Deal – Lume 3.5g 20% Off (id 135412, Tuesdays) carries unitPercentOff: 0.25. Every other “20% Off” deal on the same page — Doobie Tuesday, Muha Mates 5Pk — is configured at 0.2."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "03"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "The homepage “$15 Each” eighth lands on a $17.50-each bundle"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Hero slides Lume 1/8th Ongoing Global (“$20 Each”) and Lume 1/8th Ongoing Outlet (“$15 Each”) both deep-link to /specials/bundles/135343 = Flower 3.5g – 2/$35, $17.50 each."
    },
